{"title":"Toronto Vibrant Hues Watercolor Art Social","startsAt":"2026-10-29T15:00:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-29T16:00:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"We are hosting a relaxed watercolor painting session for our language exchange community here in Toronto. This is a chance to step away from our usual conversation practice and try something creative together. We will have basic supplies on hand, and the goal is simply to play with colors and enjoy the process in a low-pressure environment. You do not need to be an artist to join; it is just a nice way to unwind and connect with others in the group while we work on our paintings.\n\nThe session is open to anyone in the Global Tongue Masters community who wants to spend a couple of hours focusing on something visual. Whether you are looking to practice a new language while you paint or you just want a quiet space to meet some familiar faces, you are very welcome to attend. We will be set up to chat comfortably as we work, so expect a friendly, informal atmosphere.\n\nIf you are interested in joining us for this afternoon of creativity, please take a moment to RSVP so we can make sure we have enough materials for everyone. We look forward to seeing you there.","venue":{"name":"JJHW+4R Toronto","address":"JJHW+4R Toronto, Toronto","lat":43.62781,"lng":-79.352936,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":null,"group":"Global Tongue Masters Language Exchange Social","image":"/images/fallbacks/redesign/group-cover-4-wide.webp"}